[12:22] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'extension and essentially all it\'s got there is the video masked motion context node in before your K sampler. Set the context length to 39 and you\'ll be golden. It does allow other values, but'

[12:36] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '39 is typically the best choice in all cases. As each new video gets those context frames put in at the beginning, you\'ll need to trim them out again for the final video, meaning it will be just'

